# The groups of the cluster scenarios: which scenarios run together in one job of the
# integration test (make integration INTEGRATION_PART=GROUP). One line per scenario,
# "GROUP FUNCTION", where FUNCTION is the function the scenario is registered with in
# cluster-scenarios/. scripts/cluster-groups.sh reads this file, and its check (part of
# make unit) fails unless every scenario is in exactly one group.
#
# The groups are balanced by how long their scenarios take, not by topic, so that the jobs end
# at about the same time and none takes much more than a minute and a half. A new scenario goes
# into the group that is the shortest. Measured on 2026-11-17 in seconds, with the start of
# every scenario counted: cluster-1 67, cluster-2 67, cluster-3 70, cluster-4 69.
#

